e explicit contrast border and suppress decorative shadows. */","+/* High-contrast themes suppress decorative shadows and separate the band with an explicit border. */"," .hc-black .prompt-timeline-sticky-band,"," .hc-light .prompt-timeline-sticky-band {"," \tbox-shadow: none;","+\tborder-bottom: var(--vscode-strokeThickness) solid var(--vscode-contrastBorder);"," }"," ","-/* The centered host mirrors the session header: the shared centered-content width (sessionView.css:","- * .session-view-centered-content / --session-view-centered-content-max-width) with the header bar's","- * 10px side padding (chatCompositeBar.css: .chat-composite-bar.session-header-bar). The band inside","- * fills the padded area. */","+/* The band spans the transcript column, which the chat widget already centers and caps (chat.css:","+ * .interactive-session), so the host just stretches to it. */"," .prompt-timeline-sticky-content {"," \tdisplay: flex;","-\tmax-width: var(--session-view-centered-content-max-width, 950px);","+\twidth: 100%;"," \tmargin: 0 auto;","-\tpadding: 0 10px;"," \tbox-sizing: border-box;"," }"," ","-/* The visible band mirrors .chat-composite-bar-header: it fills the padded host and carries the","- * background, hairline side and bottom border, and soft shadow, so it lines up with the header above.","- * The top is left open so it reads as anchored to the top of the transcript. The left inset matches the","- * header's status-icon column (codicon size + 6px gap) so the prompt text aligns with the title and the","- * prompts below. It overlays scrolling transcript rows, so it stays opaque by compositing the","- * (translucent) chat request-bubble tint over the opaque panel base. */","+/* The visible band: it fills the host and carries the background and the soft shadow that lifts it off","+ * the rows scrolling underneath. The left inset matches the transcript's row padding so the pinned","+ * prompt reads as the continuation of the prompt it names. It overlays scrolli